{"id": "34479", "title": "孤星", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34479.htm", "intro": "当年独孤吹云微服出巡,一眼便爱上蝶儿清丽可人的模样。他不顾她的挣扎与反抗,以霸道的姿态向世人宣告──他要定她了！而敌人发动的一场混战,使得独孤吹云心爱的蝶儿因而死亡。在哀痛之余,他抛弃王位,带着黄蝶的尸身隐居在天山。但这是怎么一回事？方才他惊睨一眼的那名女子分明是──蝶儿？！她早已死了啊！而那名女子眼中抨发的是明显的┅┅恨？！如今不管蝶儿是爱他或恨他,他都要不惜一切的代价留下她……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34479", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2187898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2187899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2187900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2187901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2187902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2187903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2187904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2187905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2187906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2187907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2187908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2187909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2187910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2187911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2187912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2187913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2187914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2187915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2187916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2187917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2187918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2187919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2187920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2187921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2187922.html", "available": false}, {"title